    </CompilerOptions>
    <Description Value="Report Manager visual report designer for the LCL, embeddable in applications: TRpDesignerLCL with ruler, object inspector, report structure, data and parameters editors, expression editor, database browser, report wizard and the AI panel (Hub account, model, schema and chat; the assistants go through api.reportman.es). On Windows the SQL editor and the chat use WebView2; elsewhere the chat uses the TurboPower IPro viewer. Home page: https://reportman.es"/>
    <License Value="Mozilla Public License 1.1 (MPL), dual licensed: the GPL may be used instead. See LICENSE.TXT."/>
